  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Just Energy Transition in Uzbekistan - 01003545</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programmes overall objective is to strengthen Uzbekistan&#x2019;s regulatory and institutional capacities to implement a Just Energy Transition, ensuring it is inclusive and responsive to the needs of all population groups, especially the most vulnerable. The programme aims to mainstream Just Transition principles into Uzbekistan&#x2019;s energy and climate policy frameworks and improve the social dimension of the country&#x2019;s Nationally Determined Contribution (NDC 3.0).</narrative>
  </description>
